---

# 16. Common Mistake

Don't use:

```dart
Icon(Icons.home)
```

when you need the user to perform an action.

Use:

```dart
IconButton(
  onPressed: () {},
  icon: Icon(Icons.home),
)
```

when the icon should be clickable.

